omnitiler (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * 0.1 two-package recipe for Ubuntu 26.04/26.10, offline from the release
    tarball. Core ships the KWin script, the Rust planner/tray binary, and
    both native settings pages (settings-only CMake build, ECM 6.24 floor,
    no kwin-dev; KWin host lower bound 4:6.6). New omnitiler-native-effect
    companion holds only the ABI-bound active-border effect, built
    effect-only against the target's own KWin headers and exactly pinned to
    the libkwin6 distro build compiled against. DEB_BUILD_PROFILES=noeffect
    keeps a core-only path with no KWin build dependencies.

 -- OmniTiler Contributors <noreply@example.com>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
